\date{2025-11-18T00:12:30Z}
\title{Pure fragment of the Swarm language}

\p{First, we go through the various types and constructs in the pure fragment of the language.  Expressions in the pure fragment can be evaluated and have no side effects, in contrast to the [command monad](001U), which embeds effectful, sequenced imperative programs.}

\p{For each type or family of types, we explain typing rules for introduced and elimination forms, as well as related built-in constants.}

